<body>
    <header class="navbar scrolled" id="navbar">
        <div class="container navbar-container">
            <a href="/" class="logo active-logo">
                <span class="logo-text">Quadem <span class="logo-highlight">Digital</span></span>
            </a>
            <div class="nav-cta">
                <a href="index.html#contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-pill">Book a Call</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="case-study-hero">
        <div class="container">
            <span class="work-tag" style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; display: block; margin-bottom: 16px;">Local Business</span>
            <h1>Complete Brand Identity & Local SEO</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">Built a fresh brand from the ground up and dominated local search results.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container case-study-content">
        <div class="case-study-image">Cover Image 3</div>
        <h2>The Challenge</h2>
        <p>A newly opened local service business needed to establish credibility quickly and attract customers in a highly competitive geographic area. They lacked a cohesive brand identity and had zero online presence.</p>
        
        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <p>We designed a premium brand identity, including a memorable logo, color palette, and brand guidelines. Next, we built a fast, conversion-optimized website and implemented a rigorous local SEO strategy. This included optimizing their Google Business Profile, building local citations, and creating location-specific content.</p>
        
        <h2>The Results</h2>
        <div class="work-result" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <span class="result-metric">#1</span>
            <span class="result-text">Ranking for core keywords</span>
        </div>
        <p>Within four months, the business secured the #1 spot in Google's Local Pack for their primary services. Their organic call volume tripled, and their professional branding helped them command higher prices than their competitors.</p>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 60px;">
            <a href="/projects" class="btn btn-ghost btn-pill">← Back to Projects</a>
